Z||000006||1FST2M6||03-23-2001||10:46 AM||||thier units work on carberated cars and cars that are already running on the lean side. cause it blocks some of the air and fattens up the mixture. on carberated cars it does its job of mixing up the a/f and giving the motor a more evenly distributed amount to each cylinder. but on our cars and most EFI cars dont waste your time and $... ||||reg||1
